WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.400
Show the correct family context. Parent messages belong to the signed-in family. Verify the linked family before troubleshooting a conversation.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:26.800
Read before responding. Review the conversation context. Staff should choose the smallest correct audience in their communication workspace.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:40.200
Review the final message. Check recipients and wording before any send. Drafted text and AI suggestions still require a staff review.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:53.600
Verify the send result. An accepted email request is not proof of delivery. If the result is uncertain, inspect the status before sending again.

